  "cited_article_id": "configure-data-backup-and-compliance",
  "reply": "Only Administrators can change these settings. In the admin console go to **Settings > Security > Compliance**, review the BAA text and click **Accept and Sign**. Then go to **Settings > Data Management > Backups**, turn on **Automated Daily Backups**, choose the **90‑Day Standard** (or 1‑Year Extended) retention tier, and click **Save Changes**. If your historical export still fails, check that the storage bucket permissions allow write access from the application’s IP whitelist; if the export does not appear within 24 hours, contact support to manually trigger the retrieval queue."
}
